content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/onremove(_:perform:)-2t2p"]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"extendedModule":"WorldModule","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/Hooks.swift#L164","fileName":"Hooks.swift"},"symbolKind":"method","externalID":"s:11WorldModule0A0V8onRemove_7performyxm_yACz_AA6EntityVxtYbctAA9ComponentRzlF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","title":"onRemove(_:perform:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"onRemove","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".Type, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"perform","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"inout","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"World","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule0A0V"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Entity","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/onRemove(_:perform:)-2t2p","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Registers a closure to run whenever an entity loses a component of the given type.","type":"text"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Responding to Component Changes with Hooks","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/onAdd(_:perform:)